  "seasonal": {
    "_doc": "Seasonal and time-of-day ambience (story 12.2): while the `when` of an effect holds (seasons and/or day phases, weather it must not be, `day`: only in daylight) it emits `rate` particles per second over a view of refArea px2 into the effect's emitter, at fixed pseudo-random places (no Math.random: the seeded smoke runs stay repeatable), scaled by the quality tier and capped by the emitter's share. `ground`: only where that surface lies. Other effects of the set: snow footprints and ice chips (surfaceFx snow-puff / ice-chips under the movers on those surfaces), leaf piles (autumn leaves kicked up on grass), exhaust puffs behind driving traffic, sprinklers and the pond fountain (map objects `ambient` kind sprinkler / fountain), canal fish ripples, coin sparkles (loot), confetti and the trick fire trail (style:banked).",
    "refArea": 129600,
    "list": [
      {
        "id": "pollen",
        "emitter": "pollen",
        "rate": 6,
        "when": {
          "seasons": [
            "spring",
            "summer"
          ],
          "notWeather": [
            "rain",
            "snow"
          ],
          "day": true
        }
      },
